<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
</head><body>
<p>#if(!$user.lastName or $user.lastName=='')Dear $user.firstName,#else Dear $user.firstName $user.lastName,#end</p><br />
<p>
$admin.firstName $admin.lastName has recently created user account for you at $productName ($HOST). We have noticed that your account still has not been activated. If you have any difficulties with activating your account and/or getting started with $productName feel free to <a href="$HOST/content/contact-us">contact us</a>.
<p/>
<p>
In order to activate your account please <a href="$HOST/auth/account?uid=$uid&cid=$companyid&sid=$serviceid">click here</a><br />
(or copy/paste and go to following link in your  web browser: $HOST/auth/account?uid=$uid&cid=$companyid&sid=$serviceid
<p/>
<p>
Thank you for your interest in our product. We are looking forward to working with you and helping you to discover the full potential of $productName.
<p/>

<p>Kind Regards,<br/>
Nilufar Nurmanova<br/>
$productName support team
</p>
$companyInfo
  </body></html>
